      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Find $x$, if $2a+4x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
